\begin{itemize}
  \item \emph{Somebody else's model}: Often we are not the first person to attempt a particular task. Your company may have a legacy model that you are charged with updating or revising. Perhaps a close variant of the problem has been discussed in an academic paper, and maybe they even released their code on the web for you to experiment with.
