\subsection{Business Continuity Planning}
In most businesses and other organisations, it is important to be able to resume normal activities as soon as possible after an emergency situation. \textit{Business Continuity Planning (BCP)} is a discipline which is used to ensure that this is possible. The main aim of BCP is described in Requirements 11.1:

